sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant W as Worker/Auth
  participant S as Session store D1
  participant M as Memberships D1
  participant P as Policy Guard
  participant DB as Tenant Data D1
  U->>W: sign in (admin host)
  W->>S: create/rotate secure session
  W-->>U: HttpOnly host-only cookie
  U->>W: mutate event X in organization A
  W->>S: verify session, csrf, expiry
  W->>M: resolve active member + role in A
  M-->>W: role and event scope
  W->>P: authorize action and org active
  alt permitted
    P-->>W: permit
    W->>DB: WHERE organization_id = A AND event_id = X
    DB-->>W: saved revision
    W-->>U: 200 + revision
  else denied
    P-->>W: deny
    W-->>U: 403 no leak
  end
